  "title": "wsutil: On Windows handle hard links in files identical",
  "description": "Use GetFileInformationByHandleEx to retrieve the Windows-specific\nvolume and 128-bit file information ID, and use that to see if\nfiles are identical instead of using _fullpath. This has the advantage\nof working in the unlikely case of hard links.\n\nGetFileInformationByHandleEx (vs just GetFileInformationByHandle)\nisn't available on Windows 7 and earlier, but we don't support even\nWindows 8 now.",
